<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">I see that you've submitted your FAFSA for financial aid consideration at ASU. There are still a few documents that you need to submit before we review your financial aid package.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">You can see these items on <a href="http://my.asu.edu/">My ASU</a> by selecting the <b>Finances </b>tab and looking at the <b>Priority Actions</b>.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">In order to be considered for certain financial aid programs, you will need to submit the remaining items by <b>June 1</b>. This date is fast approaching so I encourage you to send these documents in as soon as possible.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you have any questions about enrolling at ASU or financial aid, please contact me.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>